mlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8710;</mo><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">G</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">o</mi></msup><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mi>RTln</mi><mo>&#8289;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">K</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>2500</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><mi>ln</mi><mo>&#8289;</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>4</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">e</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>8500</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">J</mi><mo>/</mo><mi>mol</mi></math><br /><math><mo>&#8756;</mo><mi>&#160;</mi><mi>&#160;</mi></math> Absolute value of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8710;</mo><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">G</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">o</mi></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>8500</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">J</mi><mo>/</mo><mi>mol</mi></math>"
